    "q-3011": {
      "dom_id": "step-q3011",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "Find the global maximum value of the function $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$ on the closed interval $0\\le x\\le 2\\pi .$",
      "worked_solution": "Let's apply the candidates test step by step.\n\n**Step 1**: We find the critical points. Taking the derivative of $f(x)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡x-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand solving ${f}^{′}(x)=0,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\operatorname{sin}⁡x & =0 \\\\ \\operatorname{sin}⁡x & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x \\\\ \\operatorname{tan}⁡x & =-1 \\\\ x & =-\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\pi n,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer. We discard all solutions except $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\pi =\\frac{3\\pi }{4}$ and $x=-\\frac{\\pi }{4}+2\\pi =\\frac{7\\pi }{4},$ since they are the only values that belong to the given interval.\n\nSo, the critical points are $x=\\frac{3\\pi }{4},\\,\\frac{7\\pi }{4},$ and the endpoints $x=0,\\,2\\pi $ (since the derivative is not defined at the endpoints).\n\n**Step 2**: We evaluate $f(x)$ at the critical points.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)=-1 \\\\ f(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})=\\sqrt{2} \\\\ f(\\frac{7\\pi }{4}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{4})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{7\\pi }{4})=-\\sqrt{2} \\\\ f(2\\pi ) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡(2\\pi )-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\pi )=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 3**: We compare all of the values found in step $2.$\n\n- The greatest value is $f(\\frac{3\\pi }{4})=\\sqrt{2},$ so the global maximum is $\\sqrt{2}.$\n\n- The smallest value is $f(\\frac{7\\pi }{4})=-\\sqrt{2},$ so the global minimum is $-\\sqrt{2}.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14221929/assets/7645cecb4fef2af4f2e2061752957981414d63700de016ca4a535c8df219597e.png)",
